   "requires": [],
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "To reach the nth term you start at A₁ and add d one time fewer than n: Aₙ = A₁ + (n − 1)d. Put in A₁ and d, then simplify to a rule like 3n − 2. The 31st term needs only n = 31."
